<div id="A4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Image Quality vs Watermark Detection.</span> We analyze the trade-off between watermark strength (TPR@FPR=1%) and image quality (FID) computed for 1000 images at different watermarking strength levels (bias <math id="A4.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math> dependent) in <a href="#A4.T9" title="In Appendix D Additional Results ‣ Radioactive Watermarks in Diffusion and AutoregressiveImage Generative Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>. With higher <math id="A4.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math> the image quality degrades gracefully, the detection of WIAR rapidly increases (<math id="A4.p4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta=0</annotation></semantics></math> is no watermark).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T9" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T9.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:129%;">Table 9</span>: </span><span id="A4.T9.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:129%;">WIAR shows a graceful tradeoff between watermarking strength and image quality.<span id="A4.T9.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> We compute the FID and TPR@1%FPR for 1.000 images against different delta values.</span></span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<div id="A4.T9.8" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:496.9pt;height:126pt;vertical-align:-60.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(104.1pt,-26.4pt) scale(1.72085440957312,1.72085440957312) ;">
<table id="A4.T9.8.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
